<Slide notes={`RUL 是发动机还能跑多少个循环。维护要的不是还剩 87 圈这个点，而是 90% 的把握还剩 73 到 101 圈这样的区间。衡量区间看两条：覆盖率，说 90% 时是不是真有九成落进去；宽度，区间窄不窄，窄才有信息。但这两个数至少受三个约定影响：记法、校准对象、尾部分配。约定不改变预测，只改变我们怎么读它。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>RUL 区间报出的数，有多少是方法，多少是约定</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DCE7F7' }}>01 · 问题</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, height: 504, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 18, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>同一批预测、同一批发动机，只换记法，覆盖率就会变——这不是模型差异。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 368, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 520, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginBottom: 8 }}>三个报告约定</Text>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>01</Text>
          <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5, width: 454 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>记法</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>整数端点与随机 PIT：同一个预测分布，两种计分方式</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>02</Text>
          <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5, width: 454 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>对象</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>用折模型残差校准，却把集成模型拿去部署</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 34 }}>03</Text>
          <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5, width: 454 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>尾部</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>等尾分配，还是让数据自己选尾部的质量</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 18 }}>三个约定都不改变预测，只改变我们怎么读它。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 608, height: 368, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>本文的做法</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8 }}>固定预测，只换区间构造；测试标签在校准阶段不读。</Text>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, marginTop: 26 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 170, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 62, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>653</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>台 C-MAPSS 测试机</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ width: 180, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 62, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>2,587</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>条 N-CMAPSS 查询</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ width: 160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 62, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>9×4</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>构造 × 名义水平</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 24, marginBottom: 14 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>四个舰队 · 两个骨干 · 120 次训练</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8 }}>所有数字由 scripts/tim/ 的单一协议产出</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 48, marginTop: 16, borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 16, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>如果约定造成的差异与方法差异同量级，文献里的排名就无法解释。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, bottom: 20, height: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>RUL 区间测量学 · 课题组进展汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>02 / 10</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
